Sun Aug 30 18:32:50 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.2.0+git20251009.7457d69:
  * Probe for airspyhf_set_hf_att with check_function_exists instead
    of the AIRSPYHF_VER_* cascade, which demanded REVISION >= 2
    whatever MINOR was; harmless against the 1.6.8 we ship, but it
    would disable gain control on airspyhf master (1.8.1)
  * Widen cmake_minimum_required to a 2.8.12...3.10 range for CMake
    4 compatibility
- Upstream has only two tags ever (0.1.0 in 2018, 0.2.0 in 2021) and
  three commits since, so pin master via obs_scm; "+git" keeps the
  snapshot sorting above 0.2.0
- Add pkgconfig(SoapySDR) >= 0.4.0, the floor CMakeLists checks
- Drop Group tags, switch to %autosetup and run spec-cleaner
- Fix the "AirspyHF#" typo in the module description and point URL
  at the repository rather than its wiki
- Explicitly require soapy-sdr: the automatic soname dependency pulls
  only libSoapySDR, so the module could be installed with no SoapySDR
  client - not even SoapySDRUtil - to reach it

